<Base title="Contact" description="Contact PW Fit Guide about a fitting correction or a source we should add." path="/contact/">
  <div class="prose">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Contact</p>
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p>For a correction (wrong stem size on a named model, dead source, or a leak path we missed), email <a href="mailto:contact@pwfitguide.com">contact@pwfitguide.com</a>.</p>
    <p>That address goes live when the domain is connected and email routing is turned on. Until then, open an issue on the project repository if you found this site from the source tree.</p>
    <p>We cannot diagnose a live electrical or plumbing install, and we will not tell you to defeat a safety device. See the <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
